SUMMARY:Mother's Day @ The Fox Theatre x The Love Club nonprofit
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate\, sing along\, and enjoy a screening of Mamma Mia! \nMeet The Love Club\, a nonprofit supporting babies in need\, with a portion of proceeds from the “Mom-osa” bar benefiting the cause. \nThe Love Club creates its own line of baby clothing specifically for women’s charities and shelters\, diverting surplus fabric from landfill. \nGet to know this grassroots organization dedicated to bringing love\, dignity\, and a sense of pride to mothers and their babies. \nLearn more: www.theloveclub.ca
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/mothers-day-the-fox-theatre-x-the-love-club-nonprofit/
LOCATION:Fox Theatre\, 2236 Queen St. E.\, Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/27074843/the-love-club-at-the-fox-.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="The Fox Theatre":MAILTO:info@foxtheatre.ca
END:VEVENT
